{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100441","id":2235892104,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FRQGI","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100441","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100441.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100441.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100441","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100441/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100441/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100441/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ed0e3d7da837e8b4a3bcb393f9d22dfd57831b1f","number":100441,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Scene Shaders - TBN Vector Fixes","user":{"login":"StaydMcMuffin","id":38304659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzA0NjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38304659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin","html_url":"https://github.com/StaydMcMuffin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StaydMcMuffin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Part two of: #100348\r\n\r\nSupersedes #78339 sans the anisotropic fixes, which I leave for a future PR dedicated to anisotropy.\r\n\r\nAddresses two errors found in the scene shader files that relate to the TBN basis vectors, ie. the vertex normals, tangents, and bitangents/binormals.\r\n\r\nFirst and most important, the normalization of these vectors was reversed from what MikkTSpace expects.\r\nThat is to say, the vectors were left unnormalized by the end of the vertex shader, and were normalized early in the fragment shader, whereas MikkTSpace is designed to work with TBN vectors that are normalized prior to vertex interpolation, then left unnormalized for the final tangent-space transformation of the shading normal (which is, itself, subsequently normalized).\r\nNot only is this what's [officially advised](http://www.mikktspace.com/), as a result it also matches the behaviour of Blender, ensuring that assets made in Blender have their normals reconstructed _exactly_ in Godot.\r\n\r\nSecond, while the interpolated vertex normal was properly negated on backfaces, this only applied to the subsequent _shading_ normal. Other uses of the vertex normal, such as for applying **Normal Bias** to shadows, were not inverted, leading to shading errors like the one shown below.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20a5e0cf-a9e3-491e-8f8a-bb452f1caa1e) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f2bd586-fe71-4a10-a87e-59afa824bdd5) |\r\n\r\n_DirectionalLight3D with **Bias** = `0.01` and **Normal Bias** = `1.0`_\r\n_Note: The left square is a front-facing quad, the right square is back-facing._\r\n\r\n_bugsquad edit: Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/78343_","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-12-15T17:03:47Z","updated_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:46Z","closed_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:21Z","merged_at":"2024-12-20T02:11:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"1536e0e236ecd4a1e31719670eac71b2327ed2b6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"S